  "review": {
    "images": "Seven Emaar Aeon page renders visually reviewed. The Creek Beach scene leads the gallery with community scope, the building park frontage is used for the card, and the bedroom and living room are shown separately from the shared lobby.",
    "location": "Compared the Aeon official reference point with the same district on the regional map. Emaar brochure physical page 3 prints ten minutes to Burj Khalifa and fifteen to DXB. Other points of interest on that page have no printed travel estimate.",
    "floorPlans": "Fresh original Emaar packs hosted by Mitchell’s match both checked originals. Reviewed all 38 physical pages including the two covers. All 21 Tower 1 and 15 Tower 2 complete apartment sheets retained, with separate unit-area tables on Tower 2 pages 2, 3, 4 and 9. Verified every suite and balcony sum. Official site’s single floor-plan sheet duplicates Tower 2 podium 07–09. The raster broker variant contains reordered Tower 1 plans and branded covers, so the complete Mitchell’s packs are used."
  },
